{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50893","headline":"旅夜怀故人 · 符蒙","name":"旅夜怀故人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"羸形对寒影，即此更何亲。\n半夜枕前泪，穷秋乡外身。\n雨余岚色动，风静月华新。\n故友谁相忆？年来入梦频。\n（见《永乐大典》卷三○○五「九真」「人」字〖五函四十二册〗。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"符蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50893.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50893","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}